;SA MGT E100Q (10 MG/ML) WAS MIXED
 WITH 1MM MOENOMYCIN AND 1MM MNCL2 AND INCUBATED ON ICE FOR ~3
 HOURS. PRECIPITATED MATERIAL WAS REMOVED BY CENTRIFUGATION AT 16,
 000XG FOR 5 MINUTES. THE MOENOMYCIN COMPLEX WAS CRYSTALLIZED BY HANGING DROP VAPOR DIFFUSION, MIXING THE PROTEIN 1:1 WITH A RESERVOIR SOLUTION CONTAINING 0.1M NA ACETATE PH 4.6, 0.2M NACL, 30% MPD AT 295 K.
;
_exptl_crystal_grow.pdbx_pH_range   4.6 
